2 CONT *24.11.1761 	25.11.1761 	  	Lytts 	Hindrich Michelss.   	Vendela Jacobsdr   	Malin
2 CONT *26.11.1762 	28.11.1762 	  	Lytts 	Hindrich Michelsson   	Vendela Jacobsdr   	Maria
