1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ernst Saarukka gjorde två resor åren 1898-1905 tillsammans med sin bror Axel till Sydafrika. Ernst gjorde också en resa med cykel från Kapstaden till Kairo.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was known as Saarukka-Ernst.  He and his brother Axell married sisters.  He had a total of 12 children.  He could have died 1946, according to 3 other sources. June Pelo
