1 NOTE  P-6.5.  He and his father ran the estate jointly, but Matts was master from 1675.  The estate was divided in 1681 and Matts received the estate.  His brothers Anders, Erik and Jacob inherited money and animals.  In 1665 Erik and 
2 CONC Jacob bought Snåre farm in Kronoby; Erik married widow Snåre and Jacob married widow's daughter.  Jacob's descendants still live in Kronoby.  Matts was supposed to pay his sisters money as part of their inheritance, but he died be
2 CONC fore he paid.  His son Johan Mattsson became owner on his death, but was too young, so his uncle Anders ran the estate until he died 1697.
2 CONT Alitalon Isäntä 1675-1682.
